# Dark Terminal Protocol boot screen: boot.html as a Plymouth script.
#
# Lock stage: emblem, wordmark and the passphrase field (dots, blinking block,
# shake and red border on a refused passphrase, green when it is accepted). Init stage:
# Vault Boy, the progress bar and INITIALIZING SYSTEM... until the session starts.
# Shutdown and reboot show the emblem only.
#
# Every piece is cut from the mockup rendered at 1920x1080 (tools/build-plymouth); the
# layout block below says where each one sat. Other screens get the same layout scaled
# around the centre. Template: plymouth/src/vault-tec.script.

# Generated by tools/build-plymouth: piece -> x, y, w, h on the 1920x1080 grid.
